# files
Dockerfile

# `COPY static/ static/` would otherwise carry a host-generated cache-buster
# into the image and feed the JS build a stale manifest. And everything under
# static/ is hashed and served, so a .DS_Store would get a public URL.
cache-buster.json
static/script/generated/
.DS_Store
